{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05E7B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"绯红金刚鹦鹉和绿色的大绿金刚鹦鹉，也是哥斯达黎加的代表性鸟类。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"虽然属于鹦鹉的一种……但体型非常大，也很气派。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"金刚鹦鹉……这个名字好像听过……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不愧是鸟类学家。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"别说了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那现在金刚鹦鹉在哥斯达黎加的栖息范围呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不，这我就不知道了……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"嗯……呵呵，真拿你没办法。金刚鹦鹉不住在云雾林，而是栖息在太平洋一侧的热带雨林。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":120,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"以前好像在哥斯达黎加各地都很常见，但现在数量正在迅速减少。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"有一种说法认为，原因是大规模种植香蕉时喷洒的农药。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"也就是说，它们被赶出了栖息地。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"不过最近，保护它们的行动也越来越受到重视了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""}]}